{
  "description": [
    "ctadl query model for the TaintBench `exprespam` app. Sources and sinks are derived",
    "from the framework methods named in the source/sink IR (Jimple) signatures of",
    "exprespam_findings.json: TelephonyManager.getLine1Number() reads the phone number and",
    "the app's own Activity.managedQuery() reads the contact list (sources) --",
    "`managedQuery` is inherited from android.app.Activity, and TaintBench names it on the",
    "app class the call site's receiver is typed as, so the generator matches that class.",
    "DefaultHttpClient.execute() posts the harvested data to the C2 server (sink).",
    "The `propagation` models summarize the apache-http request plumbing the leaked data",
    "travels through -- BasicNameValuePair, UrlEncodedFormEntity/StringEntity,",
    "HttpPost.<init> and HttpPost.setEntity all forward their argument into the object they",
    "build. None of those classes has a body in the APK, so without a summary the taint stops",
    "before it reaches `execute`. `ctadl index` consumes these (they become function",
    "summaries) and `ctadl query` the sources and sinks; xtask passes this file to both.",
    "ctadl ignores the non-schema `description` key, as it does `expected_lines` in the",
    "nightly models."
  ],
  "model_generators": [
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "name": "getLine1Number",
          "parent": "Landroid/telephony/TelephonyManager;"
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "sources": [
          {
            "kind": "DeviceData",
            "port": "Return"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "name": "managedQuery",
          "parent": "Lfrhfsd/siksdk/ujdsfjkfsd/WrehifsdkjsActivity;"
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "sources": [
          {
            "kind": "ContactData",
            "port": "Return"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "name": "execute",
          "parent": "Lorg/apache/http/impl/client/DefaultHttpClient;"
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "sinks": [
          {
            "kind": "Exfiltration",
            "port": "Argument(*)"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "name": "<init>",
          "parents": [
            "Lorg/apache/http/message/BasicNameValuePair;"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "propagation": [
          {
            "input": "Argument(1)",
            "output": "Argument(0)"
          },
          {
            "input": "Argument(2)",
            "output": "Argument(0)"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "name": "<init>",
          "parents": [
            "Lorg/apache/http/client/entity/UrlEncodedFormEntity;",
            "Lorg/apache/http/entity/StringEntity;",
            "Lorg/apache/http/client/methods/HttpPost;",
            "Lorg/apache/http/client/methods/HttpGet;"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "propagation": [
          {
            "input": "Argument(1)",
            "output": "Argument(0)"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "name": "setEntity",
          "parents": [
            "Lorg/apache/http/client/methods/HttpPost;",
            "Lorg/apache/http/client/methods/HttpEntityEnclosingRequestBase;",
            "Lorg/apache/http/HttpEntityEnclosingRequest;"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "propagation": [
          {
            "input": "Argument(1)",
            "output": "Argument(0)"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
